  "id": "liability",
  "term": "liability",
  "definition": "In this mental health context, liability means the legal responsibility a psychiatrist, healthcare team, or institution may have in relation to a patient’s suicide or suicide risk. It refers to how the law may hold professionals or services accountable for their role in prevention and management.",
